<title>ROMANIA: Romania Uztel posts lower '96 profit.</title>
<headline>Romania Uztel posts lower '96 profit.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>					  (million of leu unless stated)</p>
<p> Gross profit			 4,459    vs   2,401</p>
<p> Net profit			   1,421    vs   2,073</p>
<p> Turnover			    45,155    vs  27,443</p>
<p> Fixed assets			28,219    vs  19,934</p>
<p> Working capital		   31,593    vs  14,252</p>
<p> Total assets			59,840    vs  34,215</p>
<p> Share capital		     21,056    vs  21,056</p>
<p> Total debts			 28,185    vs  11,511</p>
<p> Total dividends			479.2  vs   n.a.</p>
<p>NOTE -- Uztel is an oilfield equipment maker listed on the Bucharest bourse. Data, reported to the exchange, are in nominal terms and in line with Romanian accounting standards. Uztel's report said its profit last year dropped from 1995 due to high penalties on delayed payments.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
